sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User
    participant API as api/v1
    participant Mirage as Mirage Orchestrator
    participant Ghost
    participant Seed

    User->>API: POST /api/v1/intents (intent_id, stages, request_id)
    API->>Mirage: submit_issue(issue envelope)
    Mirage-->>API: accepted (intent persisted)
    API-->>User: 202 Accepted (request_id, trace_id)

    User->>API: POST /api/v1/intents/{intent_id}/reconcile
    API->>Mirage: reconcile_intent(intent_id)
    Mirage->>Ghost: command envelope
    Ghost->>Seed: seed.execute
    Seed-->>Ghost: seed.result
    Ghost-->>Mirage: event envelope
    Mirage-->>Ghost: event.ack(accepted|rejected)
    Mirage-->>API: report(intent_id, phase, completion_state)
    API-->>User: 200 OK (report + correlation ids)
